Ceri
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 77 ROTATE 3 U U
FRADES 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

ISO 0 FACE_LAST
ISO 3 FACE_LAST
ISO 2 FACE_LAST
ISO 9 FACE_LAST
ISO 2 FACE_LAST
ISO 7 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE_STACK {FRADES, ISO} FRADES
SRC Suit {HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS, SPADES}
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL FRADES Empty
        PILE ALL ISO Empty
